  <p>
    Let's create and analyze data about translations and lengths of words!
  </p>

  <paragraphs>
    <title>Overview</title>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-lengths-of-words" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's talk about languages (English, Spanish, and more), and see how they compare in terms of the lengths of their words when translating.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-lets-read-tagalog" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's learn about Tagalog (a language from the Philippines), and use math to relate it to English using graphs, trends, and scaling factors!</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </paragraphs>

  <paragraphs>
    <title>Math Topics</title>
    <ul>
      <li>percentages</li>
      <li>finding &amp; using scaling factors</li>
      <li>interpreting data</li>
      <li>graphs (dot plots)</li>
      <li>trend lines</li>
    </ul>
  </paragraphs>
</preface>
